OL,3,GNEWSAHotel linked to Oliver Cromwell to
OL,4,Areopen next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II* listed hotel with links to
OL,7,FOliver Cromwell that closed
OL,8,Funexpectantly in January has been sold
OL,9,Fand is due to reopen next year.
OL,11,FThe Hind Hotel, a 17th Century building
OL,12,Fin the centre of Wellingborough,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, is thought to have
OL,14,Fbeen used by Cromwell in the days
OL,15,Fbefore the Battle of Naseby in 1645,
OL,16,Faccording to Prop-Search.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
