OL,3,GNEWSAHotel linked to Oliver Cromwell to
OL,4,Areopen next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Hind Group, a family-run
OL,7,FNorthampton-based business, has bought
OL,8,Fthe property and said it plans to spend
OL,9,F"tens of thousands of pounds" on
OL,10,Fupdating the building that was
OL,11,F"important" to the regeneration of the
OL,12,Ftown.
OL,14,FIt was previously owned by Hind
OL,15,FWellingborough Ltd which went into
OL,16,Fliquidation.
